[2026-09-18] rc:4046747289 inline on src/test/net_tests.cpp by brunoerg (member):
I think that adding both addresses with the same source is flaky? Afaik, the addrman in this test is not deterministic, so `nKey` is random per run. Easiest fix I see is to add the addresses one at a time, after the previous one has left the new table.
